// Match on canonicals: input="canonical" matches the canonical of a concept
// instead of repeating every variant.
// The canonical must already be set by an earlier domain, so compile this file
// as a separate domain that runs after lexicon-canonicals.wow.
//
// Text: "IBM and Big Blue are the same company. Ibm shares rose."
// matches: IBM, Big Blue, Ibm

lexicon: (input="canonical") { International Business Machines } = Employer;
